cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OpenBill or its data, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "OpenBill"
abstract: >-
  One page that tells a person what their medical care and drugs actually cost, with a
  source and a date on every single number. Phase 1 covers drugs: what US pharmacies pay
  (CMS NADAC) beside what Medicare pays (Medicare Part D Spending by Drug, Medicare Part B
  payment limits), with the state, source file, effective date and retrieved date of every
  figure. The code is MIT-licensed; the data is derived from US government sources listed
  in docs/DATA_SOURCES.md.
authors:
