    value: "10.5281/zenodo.23457871"
    description: All versions of OpenBill on Zenodo (resolves to the newest release)
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.23457872"
    description: OpenBill v0.1.0 on Zenodo
keywords:
